  "description": "金融資産は MoneyForward ME の資産推移をそのまま出す（補正しない）。9口座の連携が切れていて構造的に過少、暗号資産は2023-04から手入力の固定値に近い（reports/money/history.md）。持ち物は「相場検索」を付けた物の中古相場（メルカリ SOLD 中央値）だけで、相場の無い物は合計に入れない。負債・口座別の残高は 2026-11-14 から毎日取って積んだもの（下段。MF 側に履歴が無い）。",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "資産（最新日）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "dashboard-files"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "dashboard-files"
          },
          "type": "csv",
          "source": "url",
          "parser": "backend",
          "format": "table",
          "url": "http://files/assets_now.csv",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "total",
              "text": "合計",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "total_financial",
              "text": "金融資産",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "cash",
              "text": "預金・現金",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "funds",
              "text": "投資信託",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "crypto",
              "text": "暗号資産",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "points",
              "text": "ポイント",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "goods_market",
              "text": "持ち物の相場",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "goods_count",
              "text": "相場のある物",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "date",
              "text": "日付",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "noValue": "—",
          "unit": "currencyJPY",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "相場のある物"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "none"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "vertical"
      },
      "description": "金融資産は MoneyForward ME の資産推移をそのまま出す（補正しない）。9口座の連携が切れていて構造的に過少、暗号資産は2023-04から手入力の固定値に近い（reports/money/history.md）。持ち物は「相場検索」を付けた物の中古相場（メルカリ SOLD 中央値）だけで、相場の無い物は合計に入れない。負債はこの数字に入らない（負債は下段のカード利用残高）。"
    },
